# Multi-repo workspace

This Cursor window is **intentionally** a collection of repos, not one project:

- `C:\repos\fuzzfolio-autoresearch`
- `C:\repos\FuzzFolio-MarketDataLake`
- `C:\repos\Trading-Dashboard`

**Never** call `move_agent_to_root` (or any other Cursor app-control call that pulls a multi-root workspace into a single folder). That call fails with `Cannot pull a multi-repo cloud agent into a single-folder workspace` and **stops the agent dead**.

Stay in the multi-root workspace. Set `working_directory` on shell commands to the repo you mean (`C:\repos\fuzzfolio-autoresearch`, `C:\repos\Trading-Dashboard`, or `C:\repos\FuzzFolio-MarketDataLake`).
